{"author": "raymond91125", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete\nGO:0044748 3'-5'-exoribonuclease activity involved in mature miRNA 3'-end processing\nGO:1902945 metalloendopeptidase activity involved in amyloid precursor protein catabolic process\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/30978\nPrecomposed terms.\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1kFRe79ZpdHtSunVATClfwhXY8pe7gQ1iiThFMFORxTY/edit?gid=0#gid=0\n\nImpacted groups: \nFlyBase 2\nARUK-UCL 4 - done\nUniProt 1\nTAIR 1\n \n\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\n----\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \nReactome:R-HSA-9010034 > GO:metalloendopeptidase activity involved in amyloid precursor protein catabolic process ; GO:1902945  DONE\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2025-11-04T01:17:59Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "open", "state_reason": null, "title": "Review annotations to GO:0044748 & GO:1902945", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-02-03T21:22:04Z"}
